            {
              "ref": "C21",
              "type": "str",
              "value": "Finds that 70/72 is a mixture of several older streams later intentionally synchronized, with Agrippa as the clearest Renaissance super-join. Refines the user's four variable sets into orthogonal text/script/normalization/operator/grid/ontology/protocol controls. Discovers Numbers 2 as an older homogeneous 4×3 directional 12-tribe matrix whose source-order transpose yields the diminished-seventh index quartets, strongly promoting but not proving the 3×4 musical candidate. Adds 12→4→1 camp/Tabernacle architecture and tribe-roster substitution controls.",
              "raw_value": "Finds that 70/72 is a mixture of several older streams later intentionally synchronized, with Agrippa as the clearest Renaissance super-join. Refines the user's four variable sets into orthogonal text/script/normalization/operator/grid/ontology/protocol controls. Discovers Numbers 2 as an older homogeneous 4×3 directional 12-tribe matrix whose source-order transpose yields the diminished-seventh index quartets, strongly promoting but not proving the 3×4 musical candidate. Adds 12→4→1 camp/Tabernacle architecture and tribe-roster substitution controls.",
